{
  "id": "E241",
  "title": "Lili Talks Football",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-07-17",
  "synopsis": "Germany’s national football team is knocked out, but Lili still supports them.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/793/5f21c1b29840b4f73ab6341141b1c50f0b873cf9.mp3?1531654031",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你觉得中国足球队水吗？\n\n本：丽丽，今年的世界杯你支持哪个队？\n丽丽：我支持德国队。\n本：德国队已经回家了。你为什么支持他们？\n丽丽：因为德国队的球员帅。\n本：那你觉得中国足球队“水”吗？\n丽丽：中国足球队太水了！你还知道“水”？\n本：当然知道，“水”就是长得很好看。\n丽丽：哈哈，是“帅”不是“水”。\n本：那“水”是什么意思？中国足球队爱喝水吗？\n丽丽：“水”还有一个意思是做事很不认真，做得很不好。\n本：哦，我明白了！",
    "traditional": "你覺得中國足球隊水嗎？\n\n本：麗麗，今年的世界杯你支持哪個隊？\n麗麗：我支持德國隊。\n本：德國隊已經回家了。你為什麼支持他們？\n麗麗：因為德國隊的球員帥。\n本：那你覺得中國足球隊“水”嗎？\n麗麗：中國足球隊太水了！你還知道“水”？\n本：當然知道，“水”就是長得很好看。\n麗麗：哈哈，是“帥”不是“水”。\n本：那“水”是什麼意思？中國足球隊愛喝水嗎？\n麗麗：“水”還有一個意思是做事很不認真，做得很不好。\n本：哦，我明白了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do you think the Chinese football team is bad?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：丽丽，今年的世界杯你支持哪个队？",
      "traditional": "本：麗麗，今年的世界杯你支持哪個隊？",
      "pinyin": "běn lì lì jīn nián de shì jiè bēi nǐ zhī chí nǎ ge duì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili, which team do you support in the World Cup this year?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我支持德国队。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我支持德國隊。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ zhī chí dé guó duì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I support the German team."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：德国队已经回家了。你为什么支持他们？",
      "traditional": "本：德國隊已經回家了。你為什麼支持他們？",
      "pinyin": "běn dé guó duì yǐ jīng huí jiā le nǐ wèi shén me zhī chí tā men",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: They already went back home. Why do you support them?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：因为德国队的球员帅。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：因為德國隊的球員帥。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì yīn wèi dé guó duì de qiú yuán shuài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Because the German players are handsome."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：那你觉得中国足球队“水”吗？",
      "traditional": "本：那你覺得中國足球隊“水”嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn nà nǐ jué de zhōng guó zú qiú duì shuǐ ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Do you think the Chinese national football team is “shui”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽：中国足球队太水了！你还知道“水”？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：中國足球隊太水了！你還知道“水”？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zhōng guó zú qiú duì tài shuǐ le nǐ hái zhī dào shuǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: The Chinese national football team is so bad! You know the word “shui”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "本：当然知道，“水”就是长得很好看。",
      "traditional": "本：當然知道，“水”就是長得很好看。",
      "pinyin": "běn dāng rán zhī dào shuǐ jiù shì zhǎng de hěn hǎo kàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Of course, “shui” means handsome."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "丽丽：哈哈，是“帅”不是“水”。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：哈哈，是“帥”不是“水”。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hā hā shì shuài bú shì shuǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Haha, that’s “shuai”, not “shui”."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "本：那“水”是什么意思？中国足球队爱喝水吗？",
      "traditional": "本：那“水”是什麼意思？中國足球隊愛喝水嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn nà shuǐ shì shén me yì si zhōng guó zú qiú duì ài hē shuǐ ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: What does “shui” mean? The Chinese team’s players love to drink water?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "丽丽：“水”还有一个意思是做事很不认真，做得很不好。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：“水”還有一個意思是做事很不認真，做得很不好。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì shuǐ hái yǒu yí ge yì si shì zuò shì hěn bú rèn zhēn zuò de hěn bù hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: “Shui” also has another meaning, “to do things carelessly and sloppily”."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "本：哦，我明白了！",
      "traditional": "本：哦，我明白了！",
      "pinyin": "běn ò wǒ míng bai le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok, I understand!"
    }
  ],
